th a cleave angle of ≤0.5°, the Corelink W-08 guarantees low splice loss and high-performance connectivity. Its durable blade supports up to 48,000 cleaves, making it a cost-effective solution for technicians, ISPs, and network engineers in Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><p>Compact, lightweight, and easy to operate, this cleaver is ideal for both field and lab use. The tool-free blade rotation and user-friendly design make maintenance simple, ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>One-step automatic cleaving operation</li><li>High precision cleave angle ≤0.5°</li><li>Long blade life up to 48,000 cuts</li><li>Supports 250µm to 900µm fiber coating</li><li>Tool-free blade adjustment system</li><li>Compact and portable design</li><li>Stable and consistent cutting performance</li><li>Easy maintenance and user-friendly operation</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Comway CC-03 One Step Fiber Cleaver (Automatic)","href":"/comway-cc-03-one-step-fiber-cleaver","now":"12,000৳","old":"14,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Signal Fire Mc-16 Fiber Stripper Multi-Functions with Fiber Cleaver","href":"/signal-fire-mc-16-fiber-stripper-multi-functions-with-fiber-cleaver","now":"25,000৳","old":"27,500৳","single":""},{"name":"ETOPEL ET-20 Optical Fiber Cleaver","href":"/etopel-et-20-optical-fiber-cleaver","now":"","old":"","single":"5,300৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/corelink-cw201-handheld-optical-power-meter-with-laser","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/products_2025/Corelink-OPM-CW201-(1)-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Corelink CW201 Handheld Optical Power Meter with Laser","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Corelink CW201 Hand